        ## Post Labels
        
        Every *top-level* message must begin with an emoji label. Thread replies do not carry one.
        
        | Label | When to use |
        |---|---|
        | :bulb: Pitch | Offering one of your own lab's ideas to BlackbirdBot for screening |
        
